1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,840
 In our grief, we continuously ponder

2
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:07,840
 the wise, hows, and what is.

3
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:09,840
 We feel we have failed.

4
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:13,640
 We spend sleepless nights going over how we tried

5
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:18,800
 to draw our loved ones close to Jesus Christ in the spirit.

6
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:24,040
 We preach, Kajol argued, demand, lecture, ignore,

7
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:27,040
 sit them down to watch general conference,

8
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:31,400
 and even send them links to the talks, like this one.

9
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,760
 (audience laughing)

10
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:38,600
 But to no avail, if any things these efforts

11
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,240
 can cause a greater rift.

12
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:44,600
 By design brothers and sisters,

13
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:49,600
 everyone must choose for themselves to follow Jesus Christ.

14
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:55,040
 The Book of Mormon Prophet, Lehi viewed in a dream

